# Raw dimension + facts source files. The demo loads from tmp/kpiRvb.RData;
# the .txt files contain anonymized GoT data but are bulky (kpiRvb.txt ~43 MB)
# and not needed at runtime. Sensitive originals (ds_d_kpi.bak, ds_ad_user.txt)
# stay on disk only; never committed.
data/

# Runtime state (locks, comments, scores) is excluded. Single exception is
# the loaded dataset itself, which is the canonical input the example reads
# at startup. Use `tmp/*` (not `tmp/`) so git applies the negation per-file.
tmp/*
!tmp/kpiRvb.RData

# www/bia.jpg was the Radboudumc logo (kept gitignored — it's still on disk
# at the dwhr package level for non-anonymized examples but not used here).
# www/bia.png is now the GoT direwolf rasterization, generated by the
# anonymizer; it IS committed (LaTeX needs it for PDF rendering).
www/bia.jpg
